"'fasah', 'dcsa', 'iata_cargo_xml'). Adapter dispatch keys on this code; do "
"not rename in place."
msgstr ""
"由介面卡類別引用的穩定提供者識別碼（例如 "
"'mirsal2'、'fasah'、'dcsa'、'iata_cargo_xml'）。介面卡分派依賴此代碼；請勿就地重新命名。"

